              "url": "golden-palm-swim-shorts",
              "brand": "Red Panda",
              "available": true,
              "stock_quantity": 0,
              "description": "<p>Radiate summer energy with the <strong>Golden Palm Swim Shorts</strong>. Featuring a vibrant golden yellow backdrop, this pair is brought to life with an intricate botanical print in shades of teal, deep burgundy, and slate blue. Designed for the modern traveler, these trunks combine bold aesthetics with functional comfort, making them the perfect statement piece for your next tropical getaway or pool party.</p><p><strong>Technical Details</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Branding:</strong> Distinctive Red Panda logo detailing.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fabric Composition:</strong> 100% Recycled Quick-Dry Polyester.</p></li><li><p><strong>Print:</strong> High-definition \"Golden Palm\" botanical foliage print.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fit:</strong> 6-inch inseam; modern tailored fit that hits mid-thigh.</p></li><li><p><strong>Waistband:</strong> Elasticized waistband with a contrasting white adjustable drawstring.</p></li><li><p><strong>Features:</strong> Deep side-entry pockets and a secure rear pocket with drainage grommet.</p></li><li><p><strong>Lining:</strong> Ultra-soft, chafe-free mesh liner for all-day support.</p></li><li><p><strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold, tumble dry low.</p></li><li><p><strong>SKU:</strong> RP-SW-GP88</p></li></ul>",
