              "url": "zenith-woven-long-sleeve-knit-polo-stone-taupe",
              "brand": "Red Panda",
              "available": true,
              "stock_quantity": 100,
              "description": "<p>Achieve a look of effortless sophistication with the <strong>Stone Taupe</strong> <strong>Zenith Knit Polo</strong>. This sweater is constructed with an intricate, breathable ottoman-style weave that provides both visual texture and substantial comfort. Its natural, muted color is incredibly versatile and features your subtle black bamboo logo, giving this piece a refined, upscale finish perfect for seasonal layering or a polished weekend outing.</p><p><strong>Technical Details</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Custom Detail:</strong> Black logo embroidery on the left chest.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fabric Composition:</strong> 55% Supima Cotton, 35% Modal, 10% Linen Blend.</p></li><li><p><strong>Knit:</strong> Textured ottoman stitch for depth and airflow.</p></li><li><p><strong>Collar:</strong> Self-fabric collar with clean, untipped edges.</p></li><li><p><strong>Care:</strong> Hand wash or machine wash cold on delicate cycle. Lay flat on a towel to dry. Iron low if necessary.</p></li><li><p><strong>SKU:</strong> ZN-KPL-ST488</p></li></ul>",
