              "sku": "RP-RG-SC88",
              "url": "sunlit-canopy-short-sleeve-rash-guard",
              "brand": "Red Panda",
              "available": true,
              "stock_quantity": 100,
              "description": "<p>Get ready to brave the waves while standing out. Designed with special fibers to help keep you cool and protected, the stretch-friendly <strong>Sunlit Canopy Rash Guard</strong> makes every seaside adventure a vibrant and <strong>chill</strong> time. Featuring a dynamic botanical print on a rich golden-yellow base, this top offers superb sun protection without sacrificing style.</p><ul><li><p>91% nylon, 9% spandex.</p></li><li><p>Machine wash cold with like colors on gentle, inside out. Do not use fabric softener. Non-chlorine bleach. Tumble dry low. Cool iron. Can dry clean. Do not iron the decoration.</p></li><li><p>Short-sleeve raglan crewneck shirt with a hint of stretch.</p></li><li><p>Engineered screenprint graphic (Red Panda logo) on the front chest and/or back.</p></li><li><p><strong>SurfZone®:</strong> Moisture wicking, quick drying, UPF 50+ (excellent UV protection).</p></li><li><p><strong>SKU:</strong> RP-RG-SC88</p></li></ul>",
              "productType": "single",
              "price": 49.5,
              "currency_code": "USD",
              "currency_symbol": "$",
              "locale": "en"
            },
