              "url": "tidal-weave-swimsuit-lagoon-breeze",
              "brand": "Red Panda",
              "available": true,
              "stock_quantity": 100,
              "description": "<p>Capture the spirit of the tropics with the <strong>Lagoon Breeze Tidal Weave Swimsuit</strong>. This stunning light blue color evokes crystal-clear ocean waters, making a vibrant statement at the pool or beach. Made from high-performance, quick-dry fabric, these swimming trunks feature a subtle textural weave that ensures you stay comfortable and look sharp as you move from swimming to sunbathing.</p><p><strong>Technical Details</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Custom Detail:</strong> Embroidered black bamboo logo on the lower left leg.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fabric Composition:</strong> 100% Recycled Performance Polyester.</p></li><li><p><strong>Weave:</strong> Lightweight, textured basketweave provides excellent quick-dry properties and comfort.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fit:</strong> 6-inch inseam; tailored, mid-thigh length.</p></li><li><p><strong>Features:</strong> Full elastic waistband with an adjustable drawstring, reliable side seam pockets, and a rear patch pocket with a drainage grommet.</p></li><li><p><strong>Lining:</strong> Soft and supportive internal mesh brief lining.</p></li><li><p><strong>UV Protection:</strong> UPF 50+ sun protection built into the fabric.</p></li><li><p><strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold, gentle cycle. Hang dry recommended.</p></li><li><p><strong>SKU:</strong> TS-SW-LB85</p></li></ul>",
