              "uid": "cs017e89b8bbcec4bb"
            },
            "tab_text": "Beaches",
            "body": "A chain of 1,192 islands in the Indian Ocean, the Maldives is one of the most serene, romantic, and wildly scenic destinations in the world. The islands are clustered into atolls, based on their proximity to coral reefs, and are surrounded by azure-colored lagoons.",
            "image": {
              "uid": "am22068b904c6262c1",
