            "tab_text": "Dining",
            "body": "Dining in the Maldives can be a very indulgent experience indeed. Each resort has multiple restaurants concentrating on various types of world cuisine. Not surprisingly, seafood is a prominent fixture. Vegetarians won't go hungry, though! ",
