            },
            "tab_text": "Amenities",
            "body": "Amenities in hotels can include spas, hot tubs, health clubs, conference facilities, and banqueting rooms. Hotels also often provide complimentary personal items like soap, shampoo, mouthwash, hair dryers, and irons",
